# Docker rules

- Keep compose and Dockerfiles as **scaffolding** until hosting/runtime ADRs are accepted.
- Prefer placeholders and comments that reference open decisions (OD-002, OD-004, OD-009).
- Do not bake secrets into images or compose files.
- Local overrides belong in gitignored files (e.g. `docker-compose.override.yml`).
- One concern per service definition when real services are added.
